# MCP stdio runs on the Grok Bot or Cursor computer, not on Home Assistant.
# HA_URL must be reachable from that computer. Best: Tailscale MagicDNS.
# Also fine: Nabu Casa or another public HTTPS URL.
# LAN-only IPs fail unless that computer is on the LAN (192.168.x, 10.x, 172.16-31.x).
# Grok Bot cloud computers are not on the house LAN.
HA_URL=http://homeassistant:8123
HA_TOKEN=
